The Teaching Strategies Family App helps you build connections with your child’s teachers and caregivers through clear and meaningful two-way communication streams. Stay connected to the learning that is taking place in your child’s classroom with multimedia-playlists, engaging activities, and two-way messaging with your child’s teacher.

The Teaching Strategies Family App is used by over 2,600 programs and 330,000 families to strengthen the connections between school and home.

When a teacher shares a new resource with you, you’ll be notified automatically by your preferred method of communication—email, push notification, or both.

The Teaching Strategies Family App allows you to

* seamlessly communicate with your child’s teachers;

* interact with multimedia playlists filled with family-friendly activities, videos, children’s books, and songs that support classroom instruction; 

* receive and share videos, photos, and resources from your child’s teacher that connect to classroom experiences;

* get automatic notifications about new posts by your preferred notification method;

* easily toggle between multiple children;

* facilitate family observations for inclusion in the assessment process whether in-class or remote learning;

* explore our Digital Children’s Library, with over 200 eBooks, in English and Spanish, with an interactive eReader, in The Creative Curriculum Cloud classrooms for preschool and kindergarten only;

* explore our ReadyRosie Video Library, in English and Spanish, for ReadyRosie classrooms only, and

* be assured that all content is private and secure.
